## 📁 REPOSITORY STRUCTURE

```
vaaksetu/
├── .cursorrules                 # This file
├── CURSOR_GUIDE.md              # Detailed human & agent developer guide
├── mobile/                      # ⭐ Flutter Android Application
│   ├── pubspec.yaml
│   ├── lib/
│   │   ├── main.dart            # App entrypoint & HomeScreen
│   │   ├── domain/
│   │   │   ├── models/          # DocumentAnalysis, Language, LocalizedContent
│   │   │   └── rules/           # RuleEngine (classification, scoring, keywords)
│   │   ├── data/
│   │   │   ├── repositories/    # DocumentRepository
│   │   │   └── services/        # OcrService (3-pass), TtsService (ChangeNotifier)
│   │   └── ui/
│   │       ├── core/            # AppColors, SecurityBadge, WaveVisualizer, TactileButton
│   │       └── features/        # CameraScannerView, DocumentAnalyzerView, LanguageSelectorView
│   ├── android/                 # Native Android config (Gradle Kotlin DSL)
│   └── test/                    # RuleEngine and Widget tests
├── dataset/                     # 📚 Legal & ML Dataset Hub
│   ├── sources/                 # 6 external sources (Indian Kanoon, State Registry, RBI, etc.)
│   └── synthetic/               # 88 annotated benchmark samples + evaluation scripts
├── client/                      # React Web / Kiosk interface
└── server/                      # Node.js backend
```

---

## 🛠️ ESSENTIAL COMMANDS

```powershell
# Run Flutter tests (always ensure all 9 pass before committing)
cd mobile; flutter test

# Run app on connected Android phone (e.g. OPPO K12x)
cd mobile; flutter run

# Run with AI4Bharat HuggingFace TTS token
cd mobile; flutter run --dart-define=HF_TOKEN=hf_xxxx

# Build standalone APK
cd mobile; flutter build apk --release

# Staging & pushing all changes to GitHub
cd ..; git add .; git commit -m "your message"; git push origin main
```
